  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements: One is labelled as Assertion A and the other is labelled as Reason R.</p><p><strong>Assertion A:&nbsp;</strong><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5cb32239-26a6-4ba8-9874-82ff838ac8c7-image.png\" style=\"width: 90px; height: 68px;\" />&nbsp;can be easily reduced using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Hg</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math> to&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f2c5f34d-3d49-4f15-83eb-626fbafa5a94-image.png\" style=\"width: 80px; height: 52px;\" /></p><p><strong>Reason R:</strong> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Hg</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math> is used to reduce carbonyl group to &ndash;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> &ndash; group.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Lnbfp",
      "text": "A is false but R is true",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1HE8K",
      "text": "A is true but R is false",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "AFXxy",
      "text": "Both A and R are true but R is not the correct explanation of A",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zec41",
      "text": "Both A and R are true and R is the correct explanation of A",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Clemmensen reduction: The carbonyl group of aldehydes and ketones is reduced to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;group on treatment with zinc-amalgam and concentrated hydrochloric acid.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/91fee4df-c1da-444d-b3c6-fd19cfa37c31-9896024.png\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 124px;\" /></p><p>The acid sensitive alcohol group reacts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>, hence Clemmenson reduction is not suitable for above conversion.</p><p>So, assertion is false but reason is true.</p>",
    "image": null
